## that the next sessions are likely to use. scripts/kit_props.gd reads this.
## Where each pack came from (download, licence, checksums): assets/kits/sources.json.
##
## PACKS: one line per folder in assets/kits/.
##   scale  metres per model unit, so the pack's things come out real size
##   ext    the file type (".gltf" for KayKit, ".glb" for the rest)
